						 <p>I understand why you specified it as 'British Royal Navy' in the main article (as there are several navies called Royal Navy), but an officer in the RN wouldn't call it that - he'd just call it the Royal Navy (which is its full name. and I'd heard it called anything else before).</p> <p>Anyway, this is an intriguing SCP that leaves you full of questions; this incident log doesn't answer them, but is still an enjoyable read that adds to the original article.</p> 
